    note right of Issued
        Separate telephone policy on Client, Visitor and Operator ceremony models.
        Stored HMAC binds realm, channel, transaction, purpose, actor,
        session, operation, candidate, destination digest, generation and OTP deadline.
        Wrong binding/code never consumes.
        Transport and verification require finite parent and OTP deadlines.
        Signup and APP/COM/ORG registration integrate independent destination and candidate budgets.
        Shared legacy Source proof retirement remains incomplete.
    end note
    note right of Consumed
        Challenge verifier is erased; normal verification and transport refuse replay.
        A separate domain-keyed receipt binds original proof and both result timestamps.
        Result deadline is min(verification plus 60 seconds, original transaction expiry).
        SQL timestamp replacement cannot authenticate a longer result window.
    end note
